    <item>
      <title>Code signing</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/signing/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/signing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2&#xA;  id=&#34;mac-os&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Mac OS&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&#xA;     href=&#34;#mac-os&#34;&#xA;     title=&#34;Mac OS&#34;&#xA;     aria-label=&#34;Mac OS&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;icon-anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M15 7h3a5 5 0 015 5 5 5 0 01-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 01-5-5 5 5 0 015-5h3&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;8&#34; y1=&#34;12&#34; x2=&#34;16&#34; y2=&#34;12&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&#xA;  id=&#34;prerequisites&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Prerequisites&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&#xA;     href=&#34;#prerequisites&#34;&#xA;     title=&#34;Prerequisites&#34;&#xA;     aria-label=&#34;Prerequisites&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;icon-anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M15 7h3a5 5 0 015 5 5 5 0 01-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 01-5-5 5 5 0 015-5h3&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;8&#34; y1=&#34;12&#34; x2=&#34;16&#34; y2=&#34;12&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You must be a member of Apple&amp;rsquo;s Developer program to generate and use signing keys. Information can be found at &lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;https://developer.apple.com&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
