    <item>
      <title>Major Releases</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/major-release/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/major-release/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Each major release goes through the following milestones and stages:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2&#xA;  id=&#34;announcement-preparation&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Announcement Preparation&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&#xA;     href=&#34;#announcement-preparation&#34;&#xA;     title=&#34;Announcement Preparation&#34;&#xA;     aria-label=&#34;Announcement Preparation&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;icon-anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M15 7h3a5 5 0 015 5 5 5 0 01-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 01-5-5 5 5 0 015-5h3&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;8&#34; y1=&#34;12&#34; x2=&#34;16&#34; y2=&#34;12&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A release may be triggered for several reasons.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Minor Releases</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/minor-release/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/minor-release/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Between major releases, bugs are occasionally found and repaired. These fixes may be urgent enough or isolated enough that applying them incrementally to the existing ‘stable’ version is both possible and desirable. A set of such changes may be grouped together and released as a ‘minor’ version.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
