      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/dev/tech/deletion/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;It is possible for a user to attempt to delete a DocumentObject while a Task&#xA;Dialog is attempting to update that object.  Handling this in a Task Dialog&#xA;is not tidy.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
